# Gradle leaves its build cache inside android/ — lock files, checksum
# databases and executionHistory blobs. package.json's `files` allowlist pulls
# in `android`, which swept all of that into the published tarball (11 files of
# pure machine-local state, including .lock files that mean nothing on anyone
# else's disk).
android/.gradle/
android/build/
android/local.properties
ios/build/
